OL,3,GNEWSAAirport plans to expand passenger
OL,4,Aterminal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn airport could be expanded to handle
OL,7,Fplanes carrying almost three times as
OL,8,Fmany passengers under new plans.
OL,10,FSouthampton Airport has drawn up plans
OL,11,Ffor an 800 sq m (8611 sq ft) extension
OL,12,Fto its passenger terminal in Mitchell
OL,13,FWay, Eastleigh, alongside changes to
OL,14,Fthe internal layout.
OL,16,FAGS Airports, which owns the airport,
OL,17,Fsaid the extra space is needed because
OL,18,Fairlines are now operating larger
OL,19,Faircraft carrying around 200
OL,20,Fpassengers, rather than 70-seater
OL,21,Fplanes.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
