OL,3,GNEWSAAirport plans to expand passenger
OL,4,Aterminal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe airport operator said this change
OL,7,Fhas reduced the number of aircraft
OL,8,Fmovements but created a need for more
OL,9,Fspace inside the terminal due to
OL,10,Fpassenger boarding.
